  "scope": "Smooth compact outer(C.2) exact coefficient and actual conditional variance-defect identity with all probability/measurability/L2/integrability domains internal. FiniteHilbert/rank0 authored extension. Full L2-to-H1/closed outer gradient/B.13 literal operator norm-square adapters/spectral C.3/halfturn/full mains/errors/cost/composition remain separate.",
